    "about_story_6BwqhT": {
      "type": "about-story",
      "name": "About — Origin Story",
      "settings": {
        "container": "fullwidth",
        "section_bg": "#f2edec",
        "image_position": "right",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/02_where_it_began.png",
        "eyebrow": "✦ Where It Began",
        "eyebrow_color": "#7d0a50",
        "heading": "A name born from grace and eternal beauty.",
        "heading_color": "#9f9f46",
        "heading_italic_color": "#7d0a50",
        "body_1": "<p>AMYZA merges two Arabic names — <strong>MYZA</strong>, meaning grace, and <strong>AMARAH</strong>, eternal beauty. It began at a kitchen table, watching the women who raised us blend saffron, turmeric and rose into rituals passed down across generations.</p>",
        "body_2": "<p>Those recipes were never written down. They lived in hands, in scent, in the quiet confidence of women who knew their worth. We bottled that knowing — and gave it a modern soul.</p>",
        "body_color": "#7d0a50",
        "em_color": "#7d0a50",
        "btn_text": "Shop the Ritual",
        "btn_url": "",
        "btn_bg": "#7d0a50",
        "btn_text_color": "#f2edec",
        "btn_hover_bg": "#4e0a3a"
      }
    },
