    "about_founder_BEUgTx": {
      "type": "about-founder",
      "name": "About — Founder",
      "settings": {
        "container": "fullwidth",
        "section_bg": "#f2edec",
        "image_position": "left",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/03_founder.png",
        "eyebrow": "✦ A note from our Founder",
        "eyebrow_color": "#7d0a50",
        "heading": "Glow Inherited, Modern Take",
        "heading_color": "#9f9f46",
        "heading_italic_color": "#7d0a50",
        "body": "<p>I built AMYZA for the girl I was — the one who watched her mother and grandmother glow without a single fancy product, and wondered where that wisdom went. It never left. We just had to listen.</p><p>Those recipes were never written down. They lived in hands, in scent, in the quiet confidence of women who knew their worth. We bottled that knowing — and gave it a modern soul.</p><p>AMYZA is a love letter to ancestral botanical wisdom — bottled with bold, modern femininity for the woman who refuses to choose between heritage and now.</p>",
        "body_color": "#666655",
        "closing": "With love,",
        "founder_name": "The AMYZA Founder",
        "founder_role": "Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia",
        "sign_name_color": "#7d0a50",
        "sign_role_color": "#666655"
      }
    },
